        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9079d5a7-e0be-4640-a4a2-254000c3a377\",\"review_text\":\"all im going to say is this is the best muzic app\"},{\"review_id\":\"b21192cf-699e-4790-a674-029161bc4281\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely\"},{\"review_id\":\"a77838ae-857b-4506-9e10-f47b9a0054a0\",\"review_text\":\"got spofity on desktop, was so impressed i decided to check the app out, i was severly disappointed. Edit: Spotify premium definitely worth it if you have the money\"},{\"review_id\":\"e53664fb-0297-4132-a8fe-3923b8ba6e9c\",\"review_text\":\"Huge range of music available, choice is fantastic.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c119ebd-37f4-49e0-95b3-a8d7da0e1e83\",\"review_text\":\"Bad dont use it if u are muslim ok\"},{\"review_id\":\"35d29bf4-042a-4377-a58e-dd22458b40ef\",\"review_text\":\"Nice i enjoyed music best music app Easy to used..\"},{\"review_id\":\"65a2cfee-5066-4401-ba9c-0a5f05b9b3bb\",\"review_text\":\"Best freaking music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c3f90060-9097-4765-8d12-e4612d3cac7a\",\"review_text\":\"Overall the app is pretty good except that its a bit confusing on a phone rather than on a laptop. I also don't like how on a phone you can't choose what song you want to play from your playlist and you only get to hear a snippet of the song. Please change this because it comes to a very big disadvantage for people who do not wish to purchase premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7de48451-d4fe-4e24-83fc-426fb2c93950\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent for everyone and everything!\"},{\"review_id\":\"0783f988-f166-4fef-8945-6a28bb7ef39b\",\"review_text\":\"It's easy to use and figure out plus huge amount of music\"}]}"
